    "3397b495-a7d9-4a75-9551-fdf2f92d48e0": {
      "type": "accordions",
      "blocks": {
        "5284320f-2015-4065-bb46-1d6075e0bf59": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "eye",
            "title": "FOCUS ON THE CUSTOMER",
            "text": "<p>We place the customer at the heart of all our decisions, striving to understand their needs and anticipate expectations. The relationship of trust we build is the foundation of our sustainable growth.</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "bbdd1cd0-3090-4663-8b34-ffd8a60ee2da": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "heart",
            "title": "CARING FOR OUR PEOPLE",
            "text": "<p>We believe our success begins with our people. We foster an environment in which every employee feels valued, respected, and supported in their personal and professional development.</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "template--18726128484655__439b45b3-5b3c-4ab1-8c3f-c8bb1b21e89e-1681821953b414edf0-0": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "silhouette",
            "title": "WE ARE A TEAM",
            "text": "<p>We work collaboratively, sharing responsibilities and successes. It is through the union of skills, ideas, and perspectives that we find the best solutions.</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "template--18726128484655__439b45b3-5b3c-4ab1-8c3f-c8bb1b21e89e-1681821953b414edf0-1": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "title": "MAKING THINGS HAPPEN",
            "text": "<p>We take a proactive, results-oriented approach. We make commitments, face challenges, and deliver—always with rigor and a strong sense of responsibility.</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "template--18726128484655__439b45b3-5b3c-4ab1-8c3f-c8bb1b21e89e-1681821953b414edf0-2": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "lock",
            "title": "SAFETY ABOVE ALL AND RESPECT FOR THE ENVIRONMENT",
            "text": "<p>Ensuring the safety of our employees and the communities in which we operate is a non-negotiable priority. We act with environmental responsibility, adopting practices that protect the planet and promote a more sustainable future.</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "7222d503-becf-4db5-8afa-37735ed86910": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "icon": "chat_bubble",
            "title": "Contact us",
            "text": "<p>We would greatly appreciate hearing from you and assisting you with any inquiries regarding our fabrics and solutions. <strong>Contact us here.</strong></p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "a96029a2-7aa9-4e36-930e-e7a84ab9995a": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "icon": "map_pin",
